        <section id="overview" class="py-3">
            <h2 class="pipe">Luxury Hardscaping, Custom Paving & Excavation in Southborough, MA</h2>
            <p><strong>S. Phaneuf & Associates</strong> provides high-ticket driveway paving, site development, and architectural stonework for historic estates and residential developments in <strong>Southborough, Massachusetts</strong>. Located in eastern Worcester County, Southborough contains clay-heavy soils, watershed protection zones surrounding local reservoirs, and steep terrain. Moisture-retaining clay subsoils expand significantly during winter freezing, causing unreinforced masonry walls to shift and cracking asphalt driveways. S. Phaneuf & Associates counters these conditions by excavating poor clay soils, installing deep aggregate drainage bases, and laying premium bluestone and hot-mix asphalt across Southborough properties.</p>
        </section>

        <section id="area-projects" class="py-3">
            <h2 class="pipe">Reliable Paving & Site Work Across Southborough</h2>
            <p>S. Phaneuf & Associates manages custom estate driveways, fieldstone retaining walls, and site preparation across Southborough's premier neighborhoods. In <strong>Southborough Center</strong>, crews complete historic masonry restoration, paver walkway construction, and asphalt repaving around St. Mark’s School, Southborough Town House, and Pilgrim Congregational Church. In <strong>Cordaville</strong>, teams execute site excavation, utility trenching, and asphalt resurfacing across residential properties bordering the Cordaville Historic District and local borough reservoir access points. S. Phaneuf & Associates delivers high-end craftsmanship tailored to Southborough's architectural standards.</p>
        </section>

