            <h3 class="fw-0 pt-3">Q: Are site work and paving projects in Southborough, MA restricted by watershed protection laws?</h3>
            <p>S. Phaneuf & Associates verifies all project locations relative to the Department of Conservation and Recreation (DCR) watershed protection boundaries surrounding Southborough reservoirs. Projects within protected primary or secondary zones require specialized erosion control plans, environmental siltation barriers, and permeable paving surfaces. S. Phaneuf & Associates manages all environmental permitting filings to ensure full regulatory compliance.</p>

            <h3 class="fw-0 pt-3">Q: What are the advantages of installing thermal bluestone patios in Southborough, MA?</h3>
            <p>S. Phaneuf & Associates recommends thermal bluestone for Southborough patios because thermal bluestone features a flame-treated, non-slip surface texture and uniform thickness. Thermal bluestone resists severe freeze-thaw cycles, does not absorb surface water, and provides an elegant, durable outdoor living space that complements Southborough's historic architecture.</p>
